# ===========================================================================
# SPECTRA - operator overrides.
#
# Installed to $APP_ROOT/config/spectra-overrides.env on the FIRST deploy only.
# deploy.sh never overwrites it afterwards, so edits survive every upgrade.
#
# It is mounted into the api and worker containers as an optional env_file.
# Compose applies env_file BEFORE the compose `environment:` block, so this
# file can only set keys that docker-compose.yml does not already define.
# Anything the compose file sets (backends, URLs, budgets, feature flags)
# belongs in .env instead - see .env.example.
#
# Use this file for settings introduced after this release was cut, or for
# site-specific extras SPECTRA reads straight from the environment.
# Never put a value here that also exists in .env: duplicates drift.
# ===========================================================================

# Example: a site-specific antivirus command for uploads.
#ANTIVIRUS_HOOK=clamscan --no-summary {path}

# Example: extra python logging configuration.
#PYTHONWARNINGS=ignore
